ции.</p>"}], "specifications": [{"label": "Поддерживаемые модели", "value": "Realme 9, Realme 10 4G"}, {"label": "Рамка", "value": "нет"}, {"label": "Тип дисплея", "value": "OLED"}, {"label": "Цвет дисплея", "value": "черный"}]}, {"id": 1124, "link": "/catalog/displei/displey-dlya-huawei-p40-lite-e-honor-9c-art-l29-aka-l29-v-sbore-s-tachskrinom-chernyy-or-hd-300-kd-m/", "questionUrl": "/help/program-loyalnost/", "article": "LCD-HUW-P40-LT-E-CP-B-OR", "name": "Дисплей для Huawei P40 Lite E/Honor 9C (ART-L29/AKA-L29) в сборе с тачскрином Черный - OR (HD+, 300 Кд/м², 60 Гц)", "image": "/upload/iblock/160/p7uw1z91qpvj85u2p6hxhypeltx4rbeu.jpg", "price": 800, "discountPrice": 670, "meta": {"willArrive": "", "willArriveHint": "", "arrivalType": null, "available": true, "delivery": false, "storeIdCourierDelivery": 6415, "storeCourierLink": true, "pickup": ""}, "favorite": false, "basket": {"current": 0, "max": 50, "in_stock": 8}, "tags": [], "specifications": [{"label": "Поддерживаемые модели", "value": "Huawei P40 Lite E, Huawei Honor 9C"}, {"label": "Рамка", "value": "нет"}, {"label": "Тип дисплея", "value": "In-Cell"}, {"label": "Цвет дисплея", "value": "черный"}]}, {"id": 532, "link": "/catalog/displei/displey-dlya-vivo-v25-v25e-v21-v2202-v2201-v-sbore-s-tachskrinom-chernyy-oled/", "questionUrl": "/help/program-loyalnost/", "article": "LCD-VVO-V25-CP-B-LED", "name": "Дисплей для Vivo V25/V25e/V21 (V2202/V2201) в сборе с тачскрином Черный - (OLED) (Full HD, 450 Кд/м²)", "image": "/upload/iblock/485/217cmaf6wjt9fvqc0fcw8ebzwork3xi3.jpg", "price": 2300, "discountPrice": 1950, "meta": {"willArrive": "", "willArriveHint": "", "arrivalType": null, "available": true, "delivery": false, "storeIdCourierDelivery": 6415, "storeCourierLink": true, "pickup": ""}, "favorite": false, "basket": {"current": 0, "max": 50, "in_stock": 3}, "tags": [{"id": 2, "color": "#FFAF00", "name": "OLED", "tooltipContent": "<div><b>Отличительные особенности Oled:</b></div>\n    <ul><li>высокая контрас